# Phase discipline

Read [docs/master-spec.md](docs/master-spec.md) and the current phase doc before changing code.

Work only on the current phase. The current phase is Phase 7 — live execution. See [docs/phase-7.md](docs/phase-7.md). Phase 1 through Phase 6 are complete. Phase 8 (additional exchanges) waits. See [docs/phase-8.md](docs/phase-8.md).

Feature work happens on `develop`. Merge to `main` only when the user is ready for production.

Phase 7 places Bybit cash-and-carry from Sydney Vercel on a Connected Exchange book that has a bound trade-only key. Manual Open, Close, and Unwind, and the engine tick, may place venue orders. Do not add a Fly.io worker. Do not call private exchange APIs from the browser. Paper accounts still use the Phase 4 paper ledger.

Do not create later-phase tables or speculative architecture.

Keep dependencies minimal. Prefer the simplest solution that satisfies the current phase.

Work one micro-step at a time as listed in [docs/phase-7.md](docs/phase-7.md). Stop at the end of each micro-step and wait for instruction.

Stop at the end of the phase. After acceptance criteria pass, report results and wait for instruction.
